<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>VANTAGE Studio | Dario Herrera</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --black: #050505;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --gold: #d4af37;
            --slate: #1a1a1a;
            --accent: #8e8e8e;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--black);
            color: var(--white);
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* --- Custom Scrollbar --- */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--black); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--gold); }

        /* --- Hero Section --- */
        header {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .video-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            opacity: 0.4;
            z-index: -1;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
        }

        .hero-content h1 {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 10rem);
            line-height: 0.8;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -5px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 30%, #444 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-tagline {
            font-size: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* --- Seccion Dario Herrera --- */
        .director-section {
            padding: 100px 5%;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 50px;
            background: var(--white);
            color: var(--black);
        }

        .director-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 600px;
            background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599351431202-1e0f0137899a?q=80&w=1000') center/cover;
            filter: grayscale(100%);
            transition: 0.5s ease;
        }

        .director-image:hover { filter: grayscale(0%); }

        .director-text h2 {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* --- Servicios Cards --- */
        .services {
            padding: 100px 5%;
            background: var(--black);
        }

        .grid-services {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--slate);
            padding: 60px 40px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            transition: 0.4s;
            position: relative;
        }

        .card:hover {
            background: var(--white);
            color: var(--black);
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .card span {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* --- Ubicacion (Donde pondras tu direccion) --- */
        .location {
            padding: 100px 5%;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
        }

        .location-box {
            border: 2px solid var(--white);
            padding: 50px;
            display: inline-block;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .address-text {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* --- Boton Ultra Moderno --- */
        .btn-modern {
            padding: 20px 50px;
            border: 1px solid var(--white);
            color: var(--white);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .btn-modern:hover {
            color: var(--black);
            background: var(--white);
        }

        /* --- Footer --- */
        footer {
            padding: 80px 5%;
            background: #000;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
        }

        .footer-logo {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--white);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .footer-credits {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .director-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .hero-content h1 { font-size: 4rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585747860715-2ba37e788b70?q=80&w=2000" alt="Barber" class="video-bg">

        <div class="hero-content">
            <p class="hero-tagline">Premium Grooming Experience</p>
            <h1>VANTAGE<br>STUDIO</h1>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 30px; font-weight: 300;">Cortes cl&aacute;sicos, modernos y permanentes por <strong>Dario Herrera</strong>.</p>
            <a href="#booking" class="btn-modern">Reserva Ahora</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="director-section">
        <div class="director-image"></div>
        <div class="director-text">
            <span>DIRECTOR CREATIVO</span>
            <h2>Dario Herrera</h2>
            <p>Con a&ntilde;os de experiencia en la industria, Dario Herrera ha creado un concepto donde el estilo no es una opci&oacute;n, sino una norma. Aqu&iacute; transformamos tu imagen con t&eacute;cnicas de vanguardia.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <div class="grid-services">
            <div class="card">
                <span>01</span>
                <h3>MODERN FADES</h3>
                <p>Texturizados, Mid Fades y estilos que marcan tendencia mundial.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <span>02</span>
                <h3>PERMANENTES</h3>
                <p>Cambia tu estructura. Rizos y volumen con productos de alta gama.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <span>03</span>
                <h3>CLASSIC CUTS</h3>
                <p>Old school grooming para el caballero que valora la tradici&oacute;n.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <span>04</span>
                <h3>SPA CAPILAR</h3>
                <p>Tratamientos para el cuero cabelludo y ritual de barba con toalla caliente.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="location" id="booking">
        <div class="location-box">
            <h2 style="font-family: 'Syne'; margin-bottom: 10px;">VIS&Iacute;TANOS</h2>
            <p class="address-text">
                Calle Ficticia 123, Colonia Centro, Ciudad, Pa&iacute;s.
            </p>
            <p style="color: var(--gold);">Dario Herrera te espera para tu pr&oacute;ximo cambio.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <span class="footer-logo">VANTAGE</span>
        <p class="footer-credits">Propiedad de Dario Herrera &copy; 2026</p>
        <p style="color: #444; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 10px;">VANTAGE STUDIO - TU MEJOR VERSI&Oacute;N COMIENZA AQU&Iacute;</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
